---@field TopicARN aws.ses.AmazonResourceName The ARN of the Amazon SNS topic for email sending events. You can find the ARN of a topic by using the ListTopics Amazon SNS operation.

---Represents a request to send a bounce message to the sender of an email you received through Amazon SES.
---@class aws.ses.SendBounceRequest
---@field OriginalMessageId aws.ses.MessageId The message ID of the message to be bounced.
---@field BounceSender aws.ses.Address The address to use in the "From" header of the bounce message. This must be an identity that you have verified with Amazon SES.
